i": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75234372_668411275448142_448996283010356755_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p605tqZOQXQQ7kNvwEc9LPB&_nc_oc=AdmfL5mo6wC-99abFWCVvh4-AfPFfulYBNcEZG48hOuPbTj0nCfyLz31ejPUM68aXxQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftMp3HyDt7TgRe1ebJncGZqs2k5WV66POJmIfg6Tv4MoQ&oe=699869A4"}, "display_name": "GorillaZilla", "keywords": [], "long_description": "GorillaZilla allows you to step into a virtual world where the line between reality and fantasy blurs. Feel the ground shake beneath your feet as you crush buildings, unleash powerful roars, and wreak havoc on the city skyline. Use your hands to grab, smash, and throw objects with precision, all while staying one step ahead of the military's relentless pursuit.\n\nGorillaZilla combines the thrill of augmented reality with heart-pounding gameplay, challenging you to strategize your destructive path while outsmarting the forces determined to bring you down. Are you ready to unleash your inner monster and dominate the cityscape in GorillaZilla? The concrete jungle awaits your colossal presence!", "short_description": "Welcome to GorillaZilla, the ultimate mixed reality game that thrusts you into the colossal shoes of a towering, city-stomping monster! In this immersive experience, you become GorillaZilla, a massive creature with a penchant for destruction. Your mission? Lay waste to towering skyscrapers and urban landscapes while dodging relentless attacks from the military."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://xrbootcamp.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "XR Bootcamp", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://xrbootcamp.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQU